不想 我没那心情
No. I'm just not in the mood.

24
00:01:04,180 --> 00:01:04,860
莉莉 你呢
Lily, what about you?

25
00:01:05,760 --> 00:01:06,160
知道吗
You know what?

26
00:01:06,160 --> 00:01:07,220
我可以让他们画
Maybe I will have them paint

27
00:01:07,220 --> 00:01:08,820
"史上最差教练"几个字在我额头上
"Worst coach ever" on my forehead.

28
00:01:09,440 --> 00:01:10,980
小卡最近在教新生打橄榄球
Cam's coaching freshman football,

29
00:01:10,980 --> 00:01:12,540
但他的球队总是输
and his team's losing,

30
