这让他有点紧张焦虑
and it's making him, uh, a little tense.

31
00:01:15,660 --> 00:01:16,720
快跑 快跑
Run, run!

32
00:01:16,780 --> 00:01:18,000
像保护你的孩子一样护着球
Protect it like it's your baby!

33
00:01:18,760 --> 00:01:19,880
你把你的孩子弄丢了
You dropped your baby!

34
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:20,780
你丢了你的孩子
You dropped your baby!

35
00:01:20,860 --> 00:01:21,900
他们抱着你的孩子跑了
They're running away with your baby!

36
00:01:21,920 --> 00:01:22,680
快去抢你的孩子
Go get your baby!

37
00:01:23,340 --> 00:01:24,620
这裁判比选罗素·高尔
That's the worst call since

38
00:01:24,620 --> 00:01:26,040
出演《悲惨世界》的人还差劲
they cast Russell Crowe in "Les Mis,"

39
00:01:26,460 --> 00:01:27,200
就在那啊
right there!

40
00:01:27,800 --> 00:01:29,740
你看到大家是怎么瞪我的吗
You see the way everyone's glaring at me?

41
00:01:30,060 --> 00:01:31,520
-没有 -好像我是个窝囊教练
- No. - Like a big loser coach.

42
00:01:31,520 --> 00:01:32,380
都是你自己瞎想罢了
All in your head.

43
00:01:32,380 --> 00:01:33,880
我就是新生橄榄球队的海丝特·白兰
I'm the Hester Prynne of freshman football.

44
00:01:33,940 --> 00:01:34,600
我不如在衬衫上绣一个
I may as well have a

45
00:01:34,600 --> 00:01:36,051
猩红色的"L"好了[Loser: 废物]
scarlet "L" sewn on my shirt.

46
00:01:36,060 --> 00:01:37,400
那大家会以为你是拉芙妮
Well, then, everyone would think you're Laverne.

47
00:01:37,720 --> 00:01:38,220
塔克教练
Coach Tucker.

48
00:01:39,760 --> 00:01:41,220
昨晚输得很惨啊
That was a tough loss last night.

49
00:01:41,649 --> 00:01:43,000
是啊 确实很惨
Yeah, yeah. Sure was.

50
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:44,600
我知道你很失望 肯定的
I feel your frustration. Sure do.

51
00:01:44,600 --> 00:01:46,931
米奇尔 这是特雷弗的爸爸约翰
Uh, Mitchell, this is John. He's Trevor's dad.

52
00:01:46,931 --> 00:01:48,420
-抱歉 -明星跑卫
- Sorry. - Star running back.

53
00:01:48,420 --> 00:01:49,380
恐怕打不了多久了
Well, maybe not for long.

54
00:01:49,680 --> 00:01:51,300
我正在考虑让他退队
I'm seriously thinking about pulling him from the team.

55
00:01:51,420 --> 00:01:52,100
什么 为什么
What? Why?

56
00:01:52,280 --> 00:01:53,720
因为特雷弗总是被拦截抢球
'cause trevor's getting killed out there.

57
00:01:53,797 --> 00:01:55,222
你没安排人为他阻截对手
You got no one to block for him.

58
00:01:55,222 --> 00:01:58,149
我明白你的意思了 你说得没错
I-I hear what you're saying, and you're not wrong,

59
00:01:58,160 --> 00:01:59,800
但给我一点时间
but give me a little time.

60
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:01,400
给你一星期
You got one week.

61
00:02:03,080 --> 00:02:05,440
在园游会上这样太不合适了
Well, that is not appropriate fair behavior at all.

62
00:02:06,120 --> 00:02:07,400
你知道什么能让你开心点吗
You know what might make you feel better?

63
00:02:07,460 --> 00:02:09,440
召集球队 让队员心中充满对神的敬畏
Gathering my team and putting the fear of God in them.

64
00:02:09,520 --> 00:02:10,540
我本来要说的是西班牙油条
I was gonna say a churro.

65
00:02:10,540 --> 00:02:11,600
我可以两个一起来
I can do both!

66
00:02:12,880 --> 00:02:13,940
她真是一团糟
She's a mess.

67
00:02:14,220 --> 00:02:14,620
丫头
Girl...

68
00:02:16,560 --> 00:02:18,840
快车手 转弯时悠着点
Hey, hey, lead foot, easy on the turns!

69
00:02:18,880 --> 00:02:20,060
这蛋糕我做了好几个小时呢
I worked hours on this cake.

70
00:02:20,060 --> 00:02:21,499
你确定要去吗
You're sure you want to do this?

71
00:02:22,040 --> 00:02:23,600
我要拿下蛋糕比赛
I'm going to win the cake contest,

72
00:02:23,660 --> 00:02:24,920
这样再也没什么能阻止我了
and then there'll be no stopping me.

73
00:02:24,920 --> 00:02:25,700
阻止你什么 被揍一顿吗
From what? A beating?

74
00:02:25,700 --> 00:02:28,100
冠军绶带会赢得尊重的 杰
First-place ribbons earn respect, Jay.

75
00:02:28,100 --> 00:02:29,180
但如果跟你竞争的是一群
Not if your competition's

76
00:02:29,180 --> 00:02:30,600
老女人和怪胎就没这效果了
a bunch of old ladies and weirdos.

77
00:02:30,600 --> 00:02:32,128
你就不能友善一点吗
Could you just be nice?

78
00:02:32,140 --> 00:02:33,400
你吃他练习做的那些蛋糕时
You didn't seem to care

79
00:02:33,400 --> 00:02:35,380
好像一点也不在乎啊
when you were eating all his practice cake.

80
00:02:35,740 --> 00:02:36,140
总算有车位了
Finally.

81
00:02:38,340 --> 00:02:39,480
你打算怎么办啊 伙计
What are you gonna do, pal?!

82
00:02:39,840 --> 00:02:41,420
我也正想问你呢
About to ask you the same thing.

83
00:02:41,500 --> 00:02:43,040
你没看到我的指示灯吗
Did you not see my blinker?

84
00:02:43,140 --> 00:02:45,120
-没 -那你就是瞎了 灯还在闪呢
- Nope. - Then you're blind, 'cause it's on.

85
00:02:45,300 --> 00:02:47,640
看你这样 我估计一整路都闪着呢吧
Looking at you, I'm guessing it was on the whole way here.

86
00:02:47,700 --> 00:02:50,600
我车上有卫星广播 我能跟你耗一整天
I got all day and satellite radio.

87
00:02:50,780 --> 00:02:53,120
我才不管把车停在这里是不是你的遗愿
I don't care if parking here is on your bucket list.

88
00:02:53,120 --> 00:02:55,700
我有两本有声书 一条太空毯
I've got two books on tape, a space blanket,

89
00:02:55,700 --> 00:02:57,380
手套箱里还有一整根能量棒
and a protein bar in the glove box.

90
00:02:57,480 --> 00:02:59,440
有必要的话 我就睡在这里
I will sleep here if I have to.

91
00:02:59,500 --> 00:02:59,900
我们坚决不动
We're not moving.

92
00:02:59,900 --> 00:03:01,080
随便你 但我俩要走了
Ay, but we are.

93
00:03:01,080 --> 00:03:01,900
走吧 曼尼
Let's go, Manny.

94
00:03:14,560 --> 00:03:16,220
-你是谁 -老天啊
- Who are you? - Oh, my god!

95
00:03:16,220 --> 00:03:17,740
你把我吓尿了
You scared the hell out of me!

96
00:03:18,120 --> 00:03:20,160
注意用语哦 家里有个小宝宝呢
Okay, language. There's a baby in the house.

97
00:03:20,160 --> 00:03:22,384
那宝宝是我舅舅
Uh, that baby happens to be my uncle.

98
00:03:23,160 --> 00:03:23,860
那你是哪个
Which one are you?

99
00:03:23,860 --> 00:03:26,328
你得告诉普先生你打碎了他的一瓶啤酒
You need to tell Mr. P you broke one of his beers.

100
00:03:26,700 --> 00:03:27,880
我是艾丽克斯 你是谁
I'm Alex. Who are you?

101
00:03:27,880 --> 00:03:28,953
我是他们的男保姆[曼尼]
I’m their Manny.

102
00:03:29,500 --> 00:03:30,320
得了吧
Nice try.

103
00:03:30,400 --> 00:03:32,400
我认识他家的曼尼 你和他一点也不像
I know their Manny, and you look nothing like him.

104
00:03:32,820 --> 00:03:33,960
你是海莉
Oh, you're Haley.

105
00:03:34,460 --> 00:03:36,220
我是他家的男保姆 安迪
I'm their male nanny, Andy.

106
00:03:36,220 --> 00:03:37,520
你真的得挪个位了
You really need to move.

107
00:03:37,780 --> 00:03:39,960
好吧 我去泳池边了
Okay, well, I'll be out by the pool.

108
00:03:39,971 --> 00:03:41,540
什么 不行
What? Nope!

109
00:03:41,540 --> 00:03:42,260
不行
No, no, no.

110
00:03:42,260 --> 00:03:43,500
没允许的话就不行
Not without permission, you're not.

111
00:03:43,620 --> 00:03:45,800
-我要给普先生和太太打电话 -等等
- I'm gonna call Mr. and Mrs. P. - Oh, wait!

112
00:03:45,800 --> 00:03:48,218
说真的 曼迪 你...
Um...seriously, Mandy, do you, uh --

113
00:03:48,280 --> 00:03:50,680
你真的非得那样做吗
do you really have to do that?

114
00:03:51,520 --> 00:03:52,700
我知道你在耍什么把戏
I see what you're doing.

115
00:03:53,020 --> 00:03:53,380
别费心了
Don't bother,

116
00:03:53,640 --> 00:03:54,360
我在犹他有个
because I have a girlfriend

117
00:03:54,360 --> 00:03:55,480
交往了八年的女友[八岁的女友]
of eight years back in Utah.

118
00:03:55,700 --> 00:03:57,040
她真幼齿 但我想那边的作风
That's pretty young, but I guess they do things

119
00:03:57,040 --> 00:03:57,840
也许不同吧
differently over there.

120
00:03:57,960 --> 00:03:58,900
她和我一般年纪
She's my age,

121
00:03:58,900 --> 00:04:00,760
我们订婚了 就要订婚了
and we're engaged... to be engaged.

122
00:04:00,770 --> 00:04:02,610
这叫提前订婚
It's -- it's a pre-engagement.

123
00:04:02,620 --> 00:04:03,420
她是海岸警卫队的
She's in the coast guard.

124
00:04:03,660 --> 00:04:04,920
-在犹他州吗 -是啊
- In Utah? - Yeah.

125
00:04:04,940 --> 00:04:06,800
那里有西半球最大的咸水湖
It's the largest salt lake in the western hemisphere.

126
00:04:06,960 --> 00:04:08,600
很不错 她在保护我们的湖哎
Oh, good. She's protecting our lake.

127
00:04:08,840 --> 00:04:10,020
我去泳池边啦
I'll be out by the pool.

128
00:04:10,700 --> 00:04:12,380
你老板在召唤你
Your boss is calling you.

129
00:04:15,840 --> 00:04:17,320
这位美女在这里啊
Hey! There she is.

130
00:04:17,360 --> 00:04:18,340
我不会给你钱的
Yeah, I'm not giving you any money.

131
00:04:18,340 --> 00:04:20,280
我不要你的钱 我需要的是建议
I don't need your money -- I need advice...

132
00:04:20,280 --> 00:04:21,900
关于一个女孩的
about a girl.

133
00:04:22,800 --> 00:04:24,460
真恶心 但我很感兴趣 说吧
Gross, but I'm intrigued, so talk.

134
00:04:24,900 --> 00:04:26,340
艾丽克斯 闺蜜
Alex. Hey, Girlita.

135
00:04:26,340 --> 00:04:29,240
西恩娜 闺蜜
Sienna...girl!

136
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:32,860
西恩娜太棒了 她时髦 善于处世
Sienna is amazing -- stylish, worldly --

137
00:04:32,880 --> 00:04:35,220
她刚刚来我们学校 还没意识到
and she's so new to our school, she doesn't even realize

138
00:04:35,220 --> 00:04:36,920
我比她低一个社会阶级
that I'm a full social class below her.

139
00:04:37,140 --> 00:04:38,900
我需要在她发现学校有自助餐厅前
I need to cement the friendship

140
00:04:38,900 --> 00:04:40,440
巩固我们的友谊
before she finds out we have a cafeteria.

141
00:04:41,080 --> 00:04:42,820
我到处在找你
I've been looking all over for you.

142
00:04:42,820 --> 00:04:44,922
这是我弟弟 卢克
Uh, this is my little brother, Luke.

143
00:04:45,880 --> 00:04:48,620
他想要一些建议 因为他迷上了个女孩
He wants advice on some lame crush he has.

144
00:04:48,960 --> 00:04:49,540
这可是大事啊
That's huge.

145
00:04:49,680 --> 00:04:50,060
超级重大
So huge.

146
00:04:51,100 --> 00:04:53,480
卢克 这个神秘的女孩是谁
So, Luke, who is this mystery woman?

147
00:04:53,480 --> 00:04:56,420
就是一个普通的女生啦
Um...just some girl.

148
00:04:56,420 --> 00:04:58,020
她的名字是西恩娜
And her name is Sienna.

149
00:05:01,580 --> 00:05:04,000
曼尼 我只说最后一遍
You know, Manny, I'm just gonna say this one last time.

150
00:05:04,100 --> 00:05:05,320
-我深表怀疑 -给我
- I doubt that. - Give me that.

151
00:05:06,280 --> 00:05:07,340
你想更合群吗
You want to fit in?

152
00:05:07,840 --> 00:05:09,220
靠这个蛋糕比赛
You're not doing yourself any favors

153
00:05:09,220 --> 00:05:10,180
可帮不了你什么忙
with this cake contest.

154
00:05:10,580 --> 00:05:12,080
不一定 厨师很能吸引女性
I don't know. Chefs get all the girls.

155
00:05:12,100 --> 00:05:12,660
你就是个烤蛋糕的
You're a baker.

156
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:13,840
烤蛋糕的都是女的
Bakers are girls --

157
00:05:13,900 --> 00:05:16,400
贝蒂·克罗克 菲尔斯太太 小黛比
Betty Crocker, Mrs. Fields, Little Debbie.

158
00:05:16,540 --> 00:05:17,800
那面团宝宝呢
What about the Pillsbury Doughboy?

159
00:05:18,120 --> 00:05:19,740
回得好 曼尼
That's a good one, Manny!

160
00:05:20,840 --> 00:05:22,760
瞧瞧是谁 杰·普里契特
Well, well, well. Jay Pritchett.

161
00:05:22,860 --> 00:05:24,280
你总算来了啊
Nice of you to finally show up.

162
00:05:24,380 --> 00:05:26,220
-什么情况 -你是官方公正警察
- What's happening? - You're an official fair cop.

163
00:05:26,340 --> 00:05:27,840
-你妻子给你报了名 -歌洛莉亚
- Your wife volunteered you. - Gloria!

164
00:05:27,980 --> 00:05:29,360
我爱你 玩得开心哦
I love you! Have fun!

165
00:05:29,400 --> 00:05:30,840
-这是什么玩意 -这是为了慈善事业
- What is this? - It's for charity.

166
00:05:30,960 --> 00:05:32,220
人们付钱给你 让你去
People pay for you to arrest

167
00:05:32,220 --> 00:05:33,940
把坏人抓进监狱蹲10分钟
and throw somebody in jail for 10 minutes.

168
00:05:33,940 --> 00:05:34,960
这是你的搭档
And here comes your partner.

169
00:05:35,440 --> 00:05:36,100
你好啊
What's up?

170
00:05:36,280 --> 00:05:38,260
该死 我可不要和这个小丑合作
Oh, hell, no. I'm not working with this clown.

171
00:05:38,260 --> 00:05:40,660
你叫谁小丑呢 遗愿清单
Hey, who are you calling a clown, bucket list?

172
00:05:40,660 --> 00:05:42,060
看来你俩已经见过面了
I see you two have already met.

173
00:05:42,060 --> 00:05:44,300
是我先把车开进车位的 你心里清楚
That was my space and you know it.

174
00:05:44,300 --> 00:05:46,600
跟我的车去说吧 你知道上哪去找
Tell it to my car. You know where to find it.

175
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:48,540
够了 你俩别吵了
Hey, enough of you two squabbling.

176
00:05:48,660 --> 00:05:50,780
家庭教师协会盯着我呢
I've got the PTA breathing down my neck.

177
