358
00:12:07,100 --> 00:12:09,520
宝贝 西恩娜就是他喜欢的女孩
Honey, Sienna is the girl he has a crush on.

359
00:12:09,940 --> 00:12:11,520
拜托 你没看到他看她的眼神吗
Come on, haven't you ever seen the way he looks at her?

360
00:12:11,820 --> 00:12:13,560
像他以前看万圣节糖果的眼神一样
It's same way he used to look at Halloween candy.

361
00:12:13,560 --> 00:12:15,500
天呐 他要做蠢事了
Oh, my god. He's gonna do something stupid

362
00:12:15,500 --> 00:12:16,220
他会毁了我的好事
and ruin it for me.

363
00:12:16,220 --> 00:12:17,320
我得出去
I have to get out of here.

364
00:12:17,720 --> 00:12:19,600
好吧 我有个主意 听我的
Okay. All right. I got a plan. I got this.

365
00:12:19,632 --> 00:12:20,754
我来调虎离山
I'm gonna create a distraction.

366
00:12:20,754 --> 00:12:22,686
把那个小警卫引到这来
Just got to get that little guard over here.

367
00:12:22,686 --> 00:12:24,617
你就安静地坐着
You're gonna sit down very quietly,

368
00:12:24,617 --> 00:12:25,480
坐在门边
right by the door.

369
00:12:25,480 --> 00:12:27,560
好主意 妈妈 记得告诉我结果如何
Great plan, mom. Let me know how that works out for you.

370
00:12:30,740 --> 00:12:31,700
那是个假锁
It's a fake lock.

371
00:12:31,962 --> 00:12:33,102
你要在那坐多久
How long were you gonna sit on that?

372
00:12:37,140 --> 00:12:37,620
又找到一块
Found another one.

373
00:12:38,000 --> 00:12:38,580
我就说吧
I told you.

374
00:12:38,580 --> 00:12:40,160
你每次都要这样炫耀吗
Are you gonna do that every time?

375
00:12:40,160 --> 00:12:40,800
你找到的是玻璃渣
You found glass,

376
00:12:40,800 --> 00:12:42,437
又不是消失的亚特兰大城
not the lost city of Atlanta.

377
00:12:42,437 --> 00:12:43,640
估计那个城就是因为有太多
Wow, I'm gonna chalk that one up

378
00:12:43,640 --> 00:12:44,760
未成年人饮酒才沉没的
to a lot of underage drinking.

379
00:12:44,760 --> 00:12:45,940
-你流血了 -什么
- You're bleeding. - What?

380
00:12:47,760 --> 00:12:49,740
我晕血 我晕血
I do not like blood. I do not like blood.

381
00:12:49,920 --> 00:12:50,940
-严重吗 -我看看
- Is it bad? - Here.

382
00:12:51,620 --> 00:12:52,860
-天呐 -怎么了
- Oh, my god! - What?

383
00:12:53,120 --> 00:12:55,520
你的手指又短又粗 像小胡萝卜
Your fingers are so stubby, like baby carrots.

384
00:12:55,660 --> 00:12:56,600
好吧
Sure. Okay.

385
00:12:56,780 --> 00:12:57,460
嘲笑我吧
Make fun...

386
00:12:58,180 --> 00:12:59,500
总有一天你会需要我把手伸进贩卖机里
till you need me to reach into a vending machine,

387
00:12:59,540 --> 00:13:00,560
到时候大家都要巴结我了
then I'm everyone's best friend.

388
00:13:00,660 --> 00:13:01,280
来 举着别动
Here. Hold still.

389
00:13:01,340 --> 00:13:02,620
我来压住止血
Let me put some pressure on it.

390
00:13:04,061 --> 00:13:05,800
你为什么要当男保姆呢
So, why are you a manny, anyway?

391
00:13:05,800 --> 00:13:06,940
赚钱上大学
Saving up for college.

392
00:13:07,240 --> 00:13:08,280
而且我喜欢孩子
Plus, I like kids.

393
00:13:09,283 --> 00:13:11,006
因为和他们一起你的手显得正常吗
'Cause they make your hands seem normal?

394
00:13:11,560 --> 00:13:12,800
好了 谢谢
Okay. Thank you.

395
00:13:13,140 --> 00:13:14,420
我没事了 谢谢
I'm good. Thank you.

396
00:13:16,060 --> 00:13:18,040
卢克 我不想打击你
Luke, I hate to say it,

397
00:13:18,040 --> 00:13:19,340
但也许那女孩已经离开了
but maybe this girl left.

398
00:13:19,420 --> 00:13:20,600
这也许是最好的结果
It's probably for the best.

399
00:13:20,600 --> 00:13:22,484
我是说 即便我找到她
I mean, even if I found her --

400
00:13:22,772 --> 00:13:24,789
算了 当我没说 这很难为情
ah, forget it. It's embarrassing.

401
00:13:24,800 --> 00:13:26,220
没事 说吧
No. Tell me.

402
00:13:27,120 --> 00:13:28,220
我不知道该做些什么
I wouldn't know what to do.

403
00:13:29,020 --> 00:13:30,280
我从来没有亲过女孩子
I've never kissed a girl before.

404
00:13:30,280 --> 00:13:32,658
其实没有那么难
Oh! It's not that hard.

405
00:13:32,800 --> 00:13:33,500
不如这样吧
You know what?

406
00:13:33,520 --> 00:13:35,080
我亲你一下给你看看是什么感觉
I'll kiss you once to show you how it's done.

407
00:13:35,220 --> 00:13:36,900
真的么 好 那我们去垃圾桶后面吧
Really? Okay. Want to go behind the dumpster?

408
00:13:37,160 --> 00:13:38,740
不用 在这里就可以
No. Here is fine.

409
00:13:39,240 --> 00:13:43,380
好吧 虽然跟我原来想象的不一样
Okay. It's not really how I imagined it, but...

410
00:13:43,380 --> 00:13:43,800
停下
Stop!

411
00:13:44,540 --> 00:13:46,060
什么 别理她 我们到哪一步了
What? Ignore her. Where were we?

412
00:13:46,200 --> 00:13:47,620
你就是那个女生 他喜欢你
You're the girl! You're his crush!

413
00:13:47,820 --> 00:13:49,840
他是个小怪胎 请别因此对我另眼相看
He's being a little weirdo! Please don't judge me!

414
00:13:49,885 --> 00:13:51,735
卢克 这是真的么
Uh, Luke, is this true?

415
00:13:51,980 --> 00:13:53,580
她是个书呆子 她的朋友都是书
She's a nerd! Her friends are books!

416
00:13:53,720 --> 00:13:55,280
你是发生在她身上最好的事
You're the best thing that's ever happened to her!

417
00:13:55,280 --> 00:13:57,920
-艾丽克斯 -我不知道他在说什么
- Alex? - Um, I don't know what he's talking about!

418
00:13:57,920 --> 00:14:00,000
好吧 我要去找我的朋友们了
Okay, I'm just gonna go catch up with some friends.

419
00:14:00,679 --> 00:14:02,047
西恩娜 等等
Sienna, wait!

420
00:14:04,428 --> 00:14:06,820
别伤心 反正她也配不上你
Don't be sad. You're too good for her anyways.

421
00:14:06,820 --> 00:14:08,500
是啊 谢谢 艾丽克斯
Yeah. Thanks, Alex.

422
00:14:08,500 --> 00:14:09,320
没说你
Not you.

423
00:14:09,420 --> 00:14:11,160
我在说我自己 你这个小矮人
I was talking about myself, you little gnome.

424
00:14:12,640 --> 00:14:14,060
他在那
There he is.

425
00:14:14,740 --> 00:14:16,760
再逮捕一个人 我们就能收工了
One more arrest and we can hang up our badges.

426
00:14:16,760 --> 00:14:18,471
我之前就看到这个小混混到处捣乱
I've seen this punk horsing around earlier.

427
00:14:18,471 --> 00:14:20,172
我会享受这一刻的
I'm gonna enjoy this.

428
00:14:21,420 --> 00:14:23,540
该坐牢了 穿牛仔夹克的那个
Jail time, jean jacket.

429
00:14:29,869 --> 00:14:31,812
-是不是很糟 -你会没事的
- Is it bad? - You're gonna be fine.

430
00:14:32,091 --> 00:14:34,633
我应该穿个马甲的
Aah! I should have worn a vest.

431
00:14:35,380 --> 00:14:37,680
为什么每个人都站在那里看着
Why is everyone just standing around?!

432
00:14:38,120 --> 00:14:40,080
拿条毛巾来给他擦衬衫啊
Get this man a towel for his blouse!

433
00:14:42,360 --> 00:14:43,160
好冷
So cold.

434
00:14:45,240 --> 00:14:46,580
我们差点就成功了
We were almost out.

435
00:14:47,700 --> 00:14:49,920
-我不想就这样结束 -你不许那样做
- I didn't want it to end like this. - Don't you do that!

436
00:14:50,300 --> 00:14:51,040
事情还没结束
It's not over!

437
00:14:51,460 --> 00:14:52,680
听我说
Listen to me.

438
00:14:53,620 --> 00:14:55,300
我需要你告诉我太太事情的经过
I need you to tell my wife what happened.

439
00:14:56,600 --> 00:14:57,500
告诉她这不是我的错
Tell her it wasn't my fault.

440
00:14:57,510 --> 00:14:59,271
你可以自己跟她说
You're gonna tell her yourself.

441
00:14:59,400 --> 00:15:01,000
她就站在那里 看起来很生气
She's standing right there, and she looks pissed.

442
00:15:03,760 --> 00:15:04,960
宝贝
Hi, baby.

443
00:15:07,039 --> 00:15:07,646
菲尔
Phil...

444
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:10,440
菲尔 我说了我们得回家了 说真的
Phil, when I said we needed to go home, I meant it.

445
00:15:10,520 --> 00:15:12,360
对不起 我应该听你的话
I'm sorry. I should have listened to you.

446
00:15:12,420 --> 00:15:15,320
但你一定要留下来再听一首歌
But you have to stay for just one song.

447
00:15:15,380 --> 00:15:15,780
为什么
Why?

448
00:15:16,360 --> 00:15:17,080
相信我
Trust me.

449
00:15:18,143 --> 00:15:20,120
大家好么
Whoo! How's everybody doing?!

450
00:15:20,120 --> 00:15:20,720
好
Good!

451
00:15:21,340 --> 00:15:22,460
好的 下一位 我们有请
All right, next up, we have

452
00:15:22,460 --> 00:15:24,280
一位非常特别的来宾
a very special guest joining us.

453
00:15:24,280 --> 00:15:26,880
女士们先生们 请将掌声献给
Ladies and gentlemen, give it up for...

454
00:15:26,880 --> 00:15:28,960
-哈罗德·格罗斯曼 -等等
- Harold Grossman! - Wait.

455
00:15:29,760 --> 00:15:30,360
什么
What?

456
00:15:31,195 --> 00:15:33,483
我以前从没做过类似的事情
Uh, never really done anything like this before.

457
00:15:34,337 --> 00:15:36,985
药房的一些朋友
Uh, some of the gang down at the pharmacy

458
00:15:37,260 --> 00:15:39,620
劝我来的
talked me into it, so...

459
00:15:43,503 --> 00:15:45,948
*必须花些时间*
*Gotta take a little time*

460
00:15:47,520 --> 00:15:50,580
*花些时间去思考*
*A little time to think things over*

461
00:15:52,840 --> 00:15:56,040
*读懂其中隐含的意义*
*I'd better read between the lines*

462
00:15:56,040 --> 00:16:01,340
*以便日后不时之需*
*In case I need it when I'm older*

463
00:16:01,340 --> 00:16:04,940
*在我的人生中*
*In my life*

464
00:16:04,960 --> 00:16:07,140
没想到我们的药剂师哈罗德·格罗斯曼
Turns out Harold Grossman, our pharmacist,

465
00:16:07,140 --> 00:16:08,080
是个摇滚明星
is a rock star.

466
00:16:08,240 --> 00:16:10,100
他的歌声简直可以作为良药出售
His voice is the drug he should be dispensing,

467
00:16:10,112 --> 00:16:12,529
因为很显然 那能治愈一切
because apparently, it's the cure for everything.

468
00:16:12,820 --> 00:16:15,060
-该走了 我们走吧 -别别别
- Time to go. Let's go. - No, no, no, no, no!

469
00:16:15,060 --> 00:16:18,016
等等 等等 拜托 他好棒
Stay, stay, stay, stay! Come on, he's great! Whoo!

470
00:16:19,540 --> 00:16:23,160
*我想让你告诉我*
*I want you to show me*

471
00:16:24,900 --> 00:16:28,860
*我想感受到什么是爱*
*I want to feel what love is*

472
00:16:29,080 --> 00:16:30,900
*而我知道 我知道*
*And I know, and I know*

473
00:16:30,900 --> 00:16:35,220
*我知道你可以告诉我*
*I know you can show me*

474
00:16:37,570 --> 00:16:39,180
他太棒了
Oh, he's incredible!

475
00:16:39,180 --> 00:16:42,505
-是啊 -太棒了
- I know. - Incredible!

476
00:16:43,480 --> 00:16:45,260
哈罗德·格罗斯 各位
Harold Grossman, everybody!

477
00:16:46,540 --> 00:16:47,620
我的天哪
Holy cow!

478
00:16:48,099 --> 00:16:49,222
谁能想到呢
Who knew?!

479
00:16:50,650 --> 00:16:52,000
让我们将热情持续下去
Let's keep this party going.

480
00:16:52,160 --> 00:16:53,880
接下来 我们今天还有一位来宾
Next up, we have one more guest today.

481
00:16:53,880 --> 00:16:54,880
不
Oh, no.

482
00:16:54,880 --> 00:16:56,020
哈罗德
Harold, yeah.

483
00:16:56,020 --> 00:16:57,580
哈罗德 哈罗德
Harold, Harold!

484
00:16:57,580 --> 00:16:59,520
好吧 好吧
Okay, now. Okay.

485
00:16:59,520 --> 00:17:01,160
也许哈罗德稍后可以再返场
Maybe Harold can come back a little later.

486
00:17:05,020 --> 00:17:06,389
但此时此刻
But in the meantime,

487
00:17:06,389 --> 00:17:09,097
节奏老爹乐队很荣幸地为您呈上
the Dad Beats are proud to present...

488
00:17:09,180 --> 00:17:10,280
菲尔·邓菲
Phil Dunphy!

489
00:17:10,480 --> 00:17:11,220
谁
Paul who?

490
00:17:11,820 --> 00:17:12,160
菲尔
Phil?

491
00:17:13,920 --> 00:17:14,640
菲尔·邓菲
Phil dunphy.

492
00:17:14,940 --> 00:17:16,580
-是我啊 -天呐
- Oh, Phil Dunphy. - Oh, boy.

493
00:17:26,160 --> 00:17:28,060
停车场有一辆白色面包车
There's a white minivan out in the parking lot

494
00:17:28,070 --> 00:17:33,716
车灯没关 车牌号TCB-R2D2
with its lights on -- license plate number TCB-R2D2.

495
00:17:36,820 --> 00:17:38,180
掌声送给菲尔·邓菲 大家
Phil Dunphy, everybody.

496
00:17:40,540 --> 00:17:41,760
妈 看这个
Hey, mom. Check it out.

497
00:17:41,860 --> 00:17:43,400
-我的蛋糕弄好了 -真不错啊
- I finished my cake. - Oh, good.

498
00:17:43,461 --> 00:17:46,435
这是11.5级地震之后的洛杉矶
It's Los Angeles after an 11.5 earthquake.

499
00:17:46,435 --> 00:17:48,919
我叫它"地糕"
I call it earth-cake.

500
00:17:50,104 --> 00:17:51,760
曼尼 真赞
Manny, that's amazing!

501
00:17:51,760 --> 00:17:52,640
你觉得这很赞
You think that's amazing?

502
00:17:52,920 --> 00:17:53,960
等会看我把这玩意儿
Wait till I smash this thing

503
00:17:53,960 --> 00:17:55,540
砸在伊妮德的单层蛋糕上
right on top of Enid's piece of sheet cake.

504
00:17:55,540 --> 00:17:58,360
别别别 等等 不是伊妮德干的
No, no, no! Wait! Manny, Enid didn't do it.

505
00:17:58,360 --> 00:17:59,540
-是我干的 -什么
- I did it. - What?

506
00:18:00,020 --> 00:18:01,800
是我毁了你的蛋糕
I was the one who ruined the cake.

507
00:18:01,880 --> 00:18:05,160
我怕那些男孩子嘲笑你
I was afraid that all those boys were gonna make fun of you.

508
00:18:05,680 --> 00:18:08,820
我觉得我比你更在乎你是否合群
I think I care more about you fitting in than you do.

509
00:18:09,240 --> 00:18:10,540
不 我在乎
No. I care.

510
00:18:11,120 --> 00:18:11,900
我非常在乎
I care a lot.

511
00:18:12,480 --> 00:18:14,180
只是我擅长的事情
It's just the stuff I'm good at

512
00:18:14,180 --> 00:18:16,000
不会让我受欢迎
isn't the stuff that makes you popular.

513
00:18:16,720 --> 00:18:17,940
请各位选手在60秒内
Contestants, all cakes

514
00:18:17,940 --> 00:18:20,540
将蛋糕放在评委桌前
must be at the judges' table in 60 seconds.

515
00:18:20,763 --> 00:18:23,860
这么多人 我们怎么可能挤得过去
Ay, there's no way we're gonna make it through that crowd.

516
00:18:23,860 --> 00:18:25,920
不可能挤不过去 拿着
Like heck we won't. Here.

517
00:18:25,920 --> 00:18:27,680
-什么 -跟着我
- What? - Follow my lead.

518
00:18:27,680 --> 00:18:29,340
-好的 -准备好了吗 来
- Okay. - Ready? Come on.

519
00:18:29,580 --> 00:18:32,120
看看谁终于放下他的木锤了
Oh, well, look who finally put down his mallet.

520
00:18:32,120 --> 00:18:33,922
你发完脾气了吗
You done having your little temper tantrum?

521
00:18:33,922 --> 00:18:35,260
没有那么糟啦
It wasn't that bad.

522
00:18:35,260 --> 00:18:37,220
小卡 你的行为也太幼稚了
Cam, your behavior was completely juvenile,

523
00:18:37,220 --> 00:18:38,820
我不觉得这会给莉莉
and I don't think that it set a very good example --

524
00:18:38,827 --> 00:18:40,123
别插队
Hey, hey! No cutsies --

525
00:18:40,360 --> 00:18:41,660
树立好榜样
for Lily.

526
00:18:41,800 --> 00:18:43,720
对不起 我太沮丧了
I'm sorry. I'm just frustrated.

527
00:18:45,160 --> 00:18:47,380
我感觉无法让球队反败为胜了
I-I can't seem to turn this team into a winner.

528
00:18:47,675 --> 00:18:49,840
你为什么要给自己这么大压力呢
Oh, why do you let it get you so stressed out?

529
00:18:49,840 --> 00:18:51,020
不就是橄榄球吗
It's just football.

530
00:18:51,220 --> 00:18:52,570
你知道橄榄球对我来说意味着什么吗
You know what football was to me?

531
00:18:53,160 --> 00:18:54,500
橄榄球是我的救赎
Football was my salvation.

532
00:18:54,820 --> 00:18:56,200
每当我踏上赛场
Every time I stepped onto that field,

533
00:18:56,220 --> 00:18:59,180
我就不再是那个被孤立的怪咖基佬了
I wasn't the weird gay outsider kid anymore.

534
00:18:59,920 --> 00:19:01,760
我是球队的榜样
I inspired my entire team

535
00:19:01,760 --> 00:19:03,380
因为我有想要证明的东西
because I had something to prove.

536
00:19:03,680 --> 00:19:05,880
我的那个想要证明自己的小孩去哪了
Where's my kid that has something to prove?

537
00:19:06,000 --> 00:19:06,560
妈 快点儿
Come on mom!

538
00:19:06,671 --> 00:19:08,500
快跟上我 跟紧点儿
Stay on my hip! Follow my lead!

539
00:19:08,500 --> 00:19:08,940
快
Move!

540
00:19:09,540 --> 00:19:11,860
这正是我需要的
That's exactly what I need.

541
00:19:12,588 --> 00:19:14,765
快点 快点 妈
Oh! Come on! Come on, mom.

542
00:19:15,120 --> 00:19:15,460
需要蛋糕吗
Cake?

543
00:19:16,700 --> 00:19:17,540
告诉他们你的好消息
Tell them the good news.

544
00:19:17,860 --> 00:19:19,740
-我赢了蛋糕比赛 -另外一个好消息
- I won the cake contest! - The other good news.

545
00:19:19,820 --> 00:19:21,100
他加入了球队
He made the football team.

546
00:19:21,140 --> 00:19:22,140
他们第一次赢了比赛
They won their first game.

547
00:19:22,240 --> 00:19:23,960
他们爱死我烤的香蕉面包了
And the guys love my banana bread.

548
00:19:25,724 --> 00:19:28,760
闭上眼 在你睁开眼之前
Keep your eyes closed, and before you open them,

549
00:19:28,760 --> 00:19:30,560
想想这20年来
remember that for 20 years,

550
00:19:30,720 --> 00:19:34,360
你每年都给我完美的 贴心的礼物
you have given me perfect, creative, thoughtful gifts.

551
00:19:34,360 --> 00:19:36,240
然而每年 我都让你失望
And every year, I have let you down.

552
00:19:36,240 --> 00:19:39,120
你将会感到非常糟糕 我懂
You're about to feel really bad, and I know that,

553
00:19:39,120 --> 00:19:41,460
因为这也是我每年的感受
because it's how I have felt every year.

554
00:19:42,180 --> 00:19:43,680
但是亲爱的 这不是我的目的
But, honey, it is not my intention,

555
00:19:43,680 --> 00:19:45,500
因为我爱你
because I love you.

556
00:19:47,020 --> 00:19:48,220
结婚纪念日快乐
Happy anniversary.

557
00:19:48,740 --> 00:19:52,540
天啊 中国杂技
Oh, my god. Chinese acrobats?!

558
00:19:53,380 --> 00:19:55,180
20周年 中国[与"瓷器"同音]
20 years -- China.

559
00:19:55,740 --> 00:19:56,400
你好聪明
You're brilliant.

560
00:19:58,012 --> 00:20:01,264
-没错 -伙计们 你们是我的礼物
- You got it! - Hey, guys! You're my present!

561
00:20:01,460 --> 00:20:03,000
那是什么
Oh -- oh, what's that?

562
00:20:05,200 --> 00:20:06,760
那是直升机 我应该加入他们
That's the helicopter. I should get in there.

563
00:20:06,769 --> 00:20:08,347
不不 让他们为你表演
No, no, they're -- they're here for you.

564
00:20:08,486 --> 00:20:09,319
他们是来为你表演的
They're here for you.

565
00:20:10,706 --> 00:20:12,051
亲爱的
Oh... honey.

566
00:20:20,100 --> 00:20:22,400
别担心 只是两瓶啤酒
Don't worry, it was just a couple of beers,

567
00:20:22,460 --> 00:20:24,360
而且你打扫干净了
and if you cleaned it up...

568
00:20:24,628 --> 00:20:25,609
好的 海莉 我也爱你 拜拜
Okay, Haley, I love you, too. Bye.

569
00:20:25,609 --> 00:20:26,497
抱歉 女士
Excuse me, ma'am.

570
00:20:26,980 --> 00:20:28,620
听说你被通缉了
I hear you're a wanted woman.

571
00:20:29,440 --> 00:20:31,940
你所见的可能对你不利[压在你身上]
What you see can and will be held against you.

572
00:20:31,940 --> 00:20:34,296
那你得先抓到我
You're gonna have to arrest me first.

573
00:20:34,320 --> 00:20:35,240
拿点酒来
Bring me some wine.

574
00:20:38,440 --> 00:20:40,620
普先生 有件事我要向您坦白
Mr. P., I have a confession to make.

575
00:20:40,660 --> 00:20:43,120
楼上有个更吸引人的"坦白"在等着我
I'm taking a much more interesting confession upstairs.

576
00:20:43,620 --> 00:20:44,660
乔睡着后
After Joe went down,

577
00:20:44,720 --> 00:20:46,100
我在泳池边喝了口小酒
I had a sip of beer by the pool,
